NOTE ON EMERGENCY USE

Offroute is a student project built for the GEMASTIK software development
competition. It is NOT certified emergency equipment and MUST NOT be relied
upon as a substitute for official disaster communication systems (SAR radio,
BNPB satellite links, or the 112 emergency line). Several features are
deliberately simulated rather than connected to real hardware — see TODO.md
for exactly which. Read the "AS IS" warranty disclaimer above carefully before
deploying this anywhere real lives depend on it.
